<h2>Notes</h2>

<p class="section-sub">Everything I've written down: essays, yearly reflections, project notes (also under <a href="/making/">making</a>), and the courses I've taught (also under <a href="/teaching/">teaching</a>).</p>

<ul class="entries notes-list">
{%- for note in collections.notesFeed %}
  <li class="entry">
    <span class="entry-key"><time datetime="{{ note.date | isoDate }}">{{ note.date | blogDate }}</time></span>
    <div class="entry-body">
      <span class="entry-title"><a href="{{ note.url }}">{{ note.title }}</a></span>
    </div>
    <span class="entry-cat">{{ note.category }}</span>
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
